## Component dependencies

The immutable source revisions used by the development stack are recorded in
`deps.lock`. Component sources are checked out into the ignored `.deps/src/`
directory and are not vendored into this repository.

The independently maintained Kernel, Runtime, Backend and Frontend projects
carry their own GPL-3.0 license files and notices. When redistributing binaries
that include those components, preserve the notices and source obligations
required by each component's license.

