## Removed legacy attribution

This Composition Root revision no longer contains the former lite-derived
editor loop, SDL renderer, `stb_truetype` integration or website source. The
old lite, SDL3 and stb_truetype notices are therefore not listed as active
third-party source in this repository. The CDIN website is maintained
separately at https://github.com/cdin-editor/cdin-editor.github.io.
